<title>POLAND: Paged group '96 net rises to PLN 14.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Paged group '96 net rises to PLN 14.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paged group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 8.81 vs    5.14</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  17.62 vs   13.33</p>
<p>    net profit				14.73 vs    9.98</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Paged SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				213.90 vs  214.16</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 152.24 vs  148.59</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     1.38 vs    2.96 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.73 vs    4.21</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    38.55 vs   21.40</p>
<p>    financial costs			 37.09 vs   15.06</p>
<p>    investment				65.42 vs   27.88</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
